@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam classBorderColor #456575
skinparam packageBackgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
hide empty members
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam ParticipantPadding 5
hide footbox
title Prepare (1) — snapshot trước side effect
participant InvoiceService as S
participant ProductDirectory as P
participant InvoiceBuilder as B
participant PrismaInvoiceRepository as R
database sales_db as DB
S -> R : findPrepare(actor,key)
alt key đã có
 R --> S : invoice + hash
 S -> S : payload khác →409; cùng →reuse
else key mới
 S -> P : batch(ids,cid)
 P --> S : ACTIVE + giá chính thức
 S -> B : setCashier().setItems().build()
 B --> S : InvoiceDraft
 S -> R : create(draft,key,hash)
 group local salesWrite TX / advisory lock
  R -> DB : recheck key/hash;
  R -> DB : insert PENDING/RESERVE + items
 end
end
note over S,DB
Product HTTP nằm trước local TX.
Không payment tại prepare; tiếp hình giữ hàng.
end note
@enduml
